WEBVTT

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:02.243
because if I had, I would not
be here with y’all today.

00:02:03.202 --> 00:02:04.203
(Applause and cheers)

00:02:04.912 --> 00:02:05.913
Yeah.

00:02:06.289 --> 00:02:09.125
So you know how when you like,
buck the system

00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:11.419
and go against the status quo,

00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:13.754
it makes people really uncomfortable?

00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:17.008
And invariably, people will ask,

00:02:17.008 --> 00:02:18.718
“Where do you get your confidence?”

00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:21.345
(Laughter)

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:25.516
Now some people mean it as a compliment,

00:02:25.516 --> 00:02:29.061
but very often it’s shady ...

00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:30.062
(Laughter)